{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38034","headline":"送人弃官入道 · 韩偓","name":"送人弃官入道","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙李浓阴润，皇枝密叶敷。\n俊才轻折桂，捷径取纡朱。\n断绁三清路，扬鞭五达衢。\n侧身期破的，缩手待呼卢。\n社稷俄如缀，雄豪讵守株。\n忸怩非壮志，摆脱是良图。\n尘土留难住，缨緌弃若无。\n冥心归大道，回首笑吾徒。\n酒律应难忘，诗魔未肯徂。\n他年如拔宅，爲我指清都。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38034.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38034","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}